{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちかなりry(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の中田の絵の才能の無さを晒したが故に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会 過疎りそうで怖い中田です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログで\n餃子の話ちょっとでたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜『月曜からよふかし』って番組で\n各地の餃子紹介してたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしそうだったなあ(*゜ロ゜)\nいま餃子がすごい気になるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーて\n昨日の夜、餃子食べた(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもお土産で買って帰った餃子じゃなくて\n家で冷凍してた餃子ね(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷蔵庫が壊れてたから\n冷凍してた餃子がとけて\n可哀想なことになりかけてたから\n焼いて夜ご飯になったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾のディンタイフォンで\n野菜たっぷりの蒸し餃子食べたんだけど\n珍しい餃子な感じしたんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野菜好きな中田的には\nおいしかったなあ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よければ\nみなさんのオヌヌメの餃子教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そういえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷蔵庫なおりました。\n修理のかたが来てくださったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご心配おかけしました○┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/5659924/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが心配してるのは\n冷蔵庫じゃなくて\n中田の絵心ですかねえ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、一応"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"餃子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SKE48さんの誰かと話した？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n話せなかった(;_;)\n話せた何人かは\nSKE48さんの方に挨拶に行けた子だけだったよ〜\nまあ、中田とかただのヲタクだから\nダメなのかな(´・∀・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容院の名前なんだっけ？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nPaceだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高野豆腐好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n好きだけどゴマ豆腐のが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル公演の\n一番最初に着てた制服の写メ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/5659924/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を撮ろうとしたら\n変なタイミングで撮れちゃった←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}